{"3370970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Garden", "steam_appid": 3370970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/3b42b004dd43e4a30c6446e886e8a52e.avif?t=1780786741\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Star Garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey where you’ll team up with powerful creatures called Lumi to uncover the secrets of a mysterious world waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo and Lyra, cosmic ecologists on a mission to study new ecosystems, find themselves stranded on Solaris, a vibrant and uncharted planet filled with incredible life forms. Their crash landing leads to an extraordinary encounter with the Lumi, unique creatures whose abilities may hold the key to survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise, customize, and evolve your Lumi to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Venture Fields teeming with Lumi villages, hidden areas, and untold secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mysteries of Solaris.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you return to the stars, or will Solaris change your path forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/62ef38b6510ebf390b836259dc55d50e.avif?t=1780786741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras_big/62ef38b6510ebf390b836259dc55d50e.webp?t=1780786741 width=1600 height=985 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer Battle Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and others in CosmiClash, where quick thinking and strategy lead to victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players locally or up to six online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a base Lumi, collect items to boost its abilities, and outsmart your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable events that keep every match fresh and challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in this competitive multiplayer mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/89d92d8d6833f3ad05c967569b525c54.avif?t=1780786741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras_big/89d92d8d6833f3ad05c967569b525c54.webp?t=1780786741 width=1600 height=972 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/3b42b004dd43e4a30c6446e886e8a52e.avif?t=1780786741\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Star Garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey where you’ll team up with powerful creatures called Lumi to uncover the secrets of a mysterious world waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo and Lyra, cosmic ecologists on a mission to study new ecosystems, find themselves stranded on Solaris, a vibrant and uncharted planet filled with incredible life forms. Their crash landing leads to an extraordinary encounter with the Lumi, unique creatures whose abilities may hold the key to survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise, customize, and evolve your Lumi to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Venture Fields teeming with Lumi villages, hidden areas, and untold secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mysteries of Solaris.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you return to the stars, or will Solaris change your path forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/62ef38b6510ebf390b836259dc55d50e.avif?t=1780786741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras_big/62ef38b6510ebf390b836259dc55d50e.webp?t=1780786741 width=1600 height=985 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer Battle Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and others in CosmiClash, where quick thinking and strategy lead to victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players locally or up to six online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a base Lumi, collect items to boost its abilities, and outsmart your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable events that keep every match fresh and challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in this competitive multiplayer mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/89d92d8d6833f3ad05c967569b525c54.avif?t=1780786741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras_big/89d92d8d6833f3ad05c967569b525c54.webp?t=1780786741 width=1600 height=972 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Raise cosmic pets that transform and evolve into the vehicles you ride! Explore a single-player Story Mode or battle rivals in local and online matches with up to four players locally or six online. Your interstellar adventure awaits!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/e08be1254e30195d76d68fa8373b61df65a53d18/header.jpg?t=1780786741", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/cae060d6e8e311e025a26f919e7deaf565312362/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780786741", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/cae060d6e8e311e025a26f919e7deaf565312362/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780786741", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> These requirements are not final and are subject to change before release.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "The <i>Star Garden</i> game, art, logo, and its characters are © GAME GARAGE LLC. All rights reserved.<br><br>All other trademarks, logos, and copyrights are the property of their respective owners.", "developers": ["Game Garage LLC"], "publishers": ["Game Garage LLC"], "demos": [{"appid": 3952100, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 37, "descriptio